{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658740/extras/7a040120c85f2573fc7b9603e007c890.poster.avif?t=1757084800\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658740/extras/7a040120c85f2573fc7b9603e007c890.webm?t=1757084800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658740/extras/7a040120c85f2573fc7b9603e007c890.mp4?t=1757084800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Mysterious Island</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use magic crystals to unlock new areas on the island. Each new area may contain useful resources, friendly NPCs, tricky puzzles or dangerous dungeons. You never know what surprises await you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658740/extras/ba1affa788b8d23b78a79530361273a4.poster.avif?t=1757084800\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658740/extras/ba1affa788b8d23b78a79530361273a4.webm?t=1757084800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658740/extras/ba1affa788b8d23b78a79530361273a4.mp4?t=1757084800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your New Home</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the perfect place to settle down. Gather resources, grow crops, and sell your goods at the market. Build a village and turn it into a place you can truly call home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658740/extras/fd5a5ef80bc5716b91968efab6974f5f.poster.avif?t=1757084800\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658740/extras/fd5a5ef80bc5716b91968efab6974f5f.webm?t=1757084800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658740/extras/fd5a5ef80bc5716b91968efab6974f5f.mp4?t=1757084800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the Unknown</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger lurks beneath the surface! Explore ancient temples, mysterious caves and guarded barracks\u2014each full of traps, puzzles and deadly enemies. Upgrade your gear and master new skills to overcome any threat in your way.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2658740?t=1757084800","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757084800","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658740/aeb241f4e56f97f6fb74ff911e59f3305c7fc78c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757084800","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658740/aeb241f4e56f97f6fb74ff911e59f3305c7fc78c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757084800","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658740/e